<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Monthly Training Report</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        'deep-navy': '#09104E',
                        'electric-blue': '#353DFF',
                        'bright-blue': '#333AFA',
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 font-poppins">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-4xl">
        <header class="text-center mb-8">
            <img src="/static/image/Logo Black.png" alt="3&7 Logo" class="h-12 mx-auto mb-4">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-800">Monthly Training Report</h1>
            <div class="mt-2">
                <p class="text-gray-600">January 2024</p>
                <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium">James Kevin</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600">Jaya Mandiri Basketball</p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Monthly Overview -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm p-6 mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-700 mb-4">Monthly Overview</h2>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <div>
                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">Total Training Sessions</h3>
                        <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-blue-600">40</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Morning Sessions</p>
                            <p class="text-xl font-medium">20</p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Evening Sessions</p>
                            <p class="text-xl font-medium">20</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">Training Feedback</h3>
                        <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-blue-600">90%</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Sessions with Poor Feedback</p>
                        <p class="text-xl font-medium">4</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Weekly Training Summary -->
        <div class="space-y-6 mb-8">
            <!-- Week 1 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm p-6">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-700 mb-4">Week 1</h2>
                <div class="mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200">
                    <p class="text-gray-600">10 sessions completed with good feedback</p>
            </div>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Monday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Tuesday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Wednesday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Friday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                                </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Saturday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
            <!-- Week 2 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm p-6">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-700 mb-4">Week 2</h2>
                <div class="mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200">
                    <p class="text-gray-600">10 sessions completed with good feedback</p>
                                    </div>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Monday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                                </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Tuesday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                            </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Wednesday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Friday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                                </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Saturday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
            <!-- Week 3 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm p-6">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-700 mb-4">Week 3</h2>
                <div class="mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200">
                    <p class="text-gray-600">10 sessions completed with good feedback</p>
                                    </div>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Monday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                                </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Tuesday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                            </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Wednesday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Friday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                                </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Saturday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
            <!-- Week 4 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm p-6">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-700 mb-4">Week 4</h2>
                <div class="mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200">
                    <p class="text-gray-600">10 sessions completed with 4 poor feedback sessions</p>
                    </div>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Monday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00 <span class="text-red-500 font-medium">(Poor Feedback)</span></p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Tuesday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00 <span class="text-red-500 font-medium">(Poor Feedback)</span></p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                                </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Wednesday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00 <span class="text-red-500 font-medium">(Poor Feedback)</span></p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                            </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Friday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00 <span class="text-red-500 font-medium">(Poor Feedback)</span></p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded">
                        <h3 class="font-medium">Saturday</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Morning: 08:00-10:00</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Evening: 18:00-20:00</p>
                                </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Feedback Analysis -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm p-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-700 mb-6">Feedback Analysis</h2>
            
            <div class="mb-6">
                <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">Poor Feedback Sessions</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">The athlete reported feeling awful during the following training sessions:</p>
                
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded">
                        <h4 class="font-medium">Monday, Week 4 (Morning)</h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-600">Athlete reported fatigue and muscle soreness.</p>
                        </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded">
                        <h4 class="font-medium">Tuesday, Week 4 (Morning)</h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-600">Continued fatigue with decreased performance.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded">
                        <h4 class="font-medium">Wednesday, Week 4 (Morning)</h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-600">Persistent fatigue despite reduced evening workload.</p>
                        </div>
                    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded">
                        <h4 class="font-medium">Friday, Week 4 (Morning)</h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-600">Athlete felt exhausted and requested reduced training.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div>
                <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">Recommendations</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-600">
                    <li>Consider scheduling a recovery week</li>
                    <li>Medical assessment to rule out underlying issues</li>
                    <li>Review nutrition and recovery protocols</li>
                    <li>Adjust morning training intensity</li>
                    <li>Monitor sleep quality and duration</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 